  "ingredients": [
    "5 cups sliced fresh mushrooms",
    "1.5 cups chicken broth",
    "0.5 cup chopped onion",
    "0.125 teaspoon dried thyme",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 cup half-and-half",
    "1 tablespoon sherry"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H211DLfq_qLhpcgqwxFU6RvJKB0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13096-Cream-of-Mushroom-Soup-ddmfs-step-1-261-81f3a7aee6f04f898ef002d77d30e5cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13096/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer mushrooms, stock, onion, and thyme in a large heavy saucepan until vegetables are tender, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X6sGVP0QWGY0oB0Opz26smAD0fc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13096-Cream-of-Mushroom-Soup-ddmfs-step-2-266-42941c5ef8bb45dcbb56dadc506cdd63.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13096/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully transfer the hot mixture to a blender or food processor. Cover and hold lid down with a potholder; pulse until creamy but still with some chunks of vegetable.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tnrLG5TdkBDAAHHY9D2crOECf_o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13096-Cream-of-Mushroom-Soup-ddmfs-step-3-2-269-61d065a485364a728a98058796101f88.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13096/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in the same saucepan. Whisk in flour until smooth. Whisk in salt and pepper. Slowly whisk in half-and-half and mushroom mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W76RxuXNXgUngJ14I6qCzph8uxk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13096-Cream-of-Mushroom-Soup-ddmfs-step-5-282-f0dc4fa04b45426d8dc1d61441ccbd9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13096/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring soup to a boil and cook, stirring constantly, until thickened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in sherry. Taste and season with more salt and pepper if needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ccvmDLTIBbIrb2zuK5vX9RSfsw4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13096-Cream-of-Mushroom-Soup-ddmfs-step-6-283-ed632f8282e8438c8db21740e5344f66.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13096/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
